OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing to acknowledge 'suffering of the
OL,4,Apast' as Caribbean tour begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuckingham Palace says the King will
OL,7,Fnot shy away from "colonial legacy" and
OL,8,Fthe impact of the slave trade during
OL,9,Fthe visit but, in line with the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment position, he will not
OL,11,Fapologise for Britain's role in the
OL,12,Fslave trade.
OL,14,FCharles is expected to tell young
OL,15,Fpeople at his first engagement it is
OL,16,F"only right" to "acknowledge the great
OL,17,Fsuffering of the past".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
